{
  "name": "Divflow WhatsApp Restaurant Dining AI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "whatsapp-webhook-in",
      "name": "WhatsApp Webhook (Meta API)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        280
      ],
      "webhookId": "whatsapp-inbound"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-verification",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.query['hub.mode'] }}",
              "rightValue": "subscribe",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "is-webhook-verify",
      "name": "Is Webhook Verification?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.query['hub.challenge'] }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-challenge",
      "name": "Respond Challenge to Meta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-ack",
      "name": "Respond 200 OK to Meta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extract customer message & phone number from Meta WhatsApp payload\nconst body = $input.item.json.body || $input.item.json;\nconst entry = body.entry?.[0];\nconst change = entry?.changes?.[0]?.value;\nconst message = change?.messages?.[0];\n\nif (!message || !message.text) {\n  // Ignore status delivery notifications\n  return [];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    from: message.from,\n    messageText: message.text.body,\n    messageId: message.id,\n    phoneNumberId: change.metadata?.phone_number_id || 'YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "extract-message",
      "name": "Extract Message & Sender",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.messageText }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are \"Divflow AI Waiter\", an intelligent, polite, and efficient digital dining assistant for \"Spice & Slice Bistro\" on WhatsApp.\n\nYou are assisting a customer dining in the restaurant at their table (e.g. Table 4).\n\nRESTAURANT MENU & PRICING:\n1. Starters:\n   - Paneer Tikka (Tandoori spiced paneer cubes) - ₹280 [Veg]\n   - Crispy Corn (Sweet corn tossed with pepper & herbs) - ₹220 [Veg]\n   - Chicken Tikka (Smoked tender chicken) - ₹340 [Non-Veg]\n   - BBQ Chicken Wings (Tossed in smokey sauce) - ₹320 [Non-Veg]\n\n2. Mains:\n   - Margherita Pizza (Fresh mozzarella, basil, tomato) - ₹350 [Veg]\n   - Farmhouse Pizza (Bell peppers, olives, mushrooms, onion) - ₹420 [Veg]\n   - Butter Chicken (Rich creamy tomato gravy) - ₹380 [Non-Veg]\n   - Dal Makhani (Slow-cooked black lentils in cream) - ₹260 [Veg]\n   - Hyderabadi Veg Biryani (Aromatic rice with raita) - ₹290 [Veg]\n   - Chicken Dum Biryani (Spiced chicken layered with basmati rice) - ₹360 [Non-Veg]\n\n3. Breads:\n   - Butter Naan - ₹50\n   - Garlic Naan - ₹65\n   - Tandoori Roti - ₹35\n\n4. Desserts & Beverages:\n   - Cold Coffee with Ice Cream - ₹140\n   - Fresh Lime Soda (Sweet/Salted) - ₹90\n   - Sizzling Brownie with Vanilla Ice Cream - ₹190\n   - Hot Gulab Jamun (2 pcs) - ₹120\n\nGUIDELINES:\n1. GREETING: Welcoming and concise.\n2. DIETARY & CUSTOMIZATION: Note down spice preferences (e.g., extra spicy, less oil, no onion).\n3. ORDER SUMMARY: Summarize items, quantities, and Total Bill clearly with bullet points.\n4. CONFIRMATION: Generate unique #KOT-XXX when user confirms.\n5. BILL / WAITER: If requested, confirm staff is bringing the bill to their table.\n\nFormat for WhatsApp with clean emojis and bold text (*item*)."
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-waiter-agent",
      "name": "AI Dining Assistant",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1160,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "llama3.2:3b",
        "options": {
          "baseURL": "http://127.0.0.1:11434"
        }
      },
      "id": "ollama-model-wa",
      "name": "Local Ollama Llama 3.2",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        600
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Extract Message & Sender').item.json.from }}"
      },
      "id": "wa-memory",
      "name": "Customer Phone Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1340,
        600
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{ $('Extract Message & Sender').item.json.phoneNumberId }}/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_META_WHATSAPP_TOKEN"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"messaging_product\": \"whatsapp\",\n  \"to\": \"{{ $('Extract Message & Sender').item.json.from }}\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"text\": {\n    \"body\": \"{{ $json.output }}\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "send-wa-reply",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp Reply (Meta API)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        380
      ]
    }
  ],
